Action Due — 2026-09-29', 'assignment-desk-xlsm-v1:dlpc:Assignment Desk:0007', '{"Workbook row": 7, "Candidate / Slug": "Hanson’s Hollow ends pumpkin patch after 25 years", "Coverage Area": "La Porte City", "Category": "Community", "Source / Link": "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php?story_fbid=pfbid0CYKTUgjWxRrAUQDHBbgfx81yRkPYY4FhaHvpV3ng8SwkpqQ2NM6sdh2f7cBg6ZTjl&id=100064767336242", "Date / Event Date": "46196.0", "Editorial Horizon": "This Week", "Dan Decision": "Do", "Decision Reason": "They have reached out for comment - draft story based solely on their public announcement.", "Priority": "Normal", "Status": "Retired — October production queue", "Next Action": "Dan directed removal of outdated October work Nov.11. No further action on this old production assignment; retain source/story history. Reopen only for a genuinely new verified assignment. Existing NRCS stories and published outputs were not deleted or altered.", "Action Due": "46294.0", "New Since Last Run": "Oct.4 public-announcement draft removes unsupported implication that an interview is underway.", "Developing?": "No", "Follow-up Owed?": "No", "Graphic Needed?": "No", "Graphic Type": "None", "Script / Treatment Notes": "Potential local feature and timely service item. Confirm the 2026 situation directly; do not describe the whole business as permanently closed. Dan to decide treatment.", "Jack Notes": "Found during event discovery. In a June 23 Facebook post, Hanson’s Hollow says it is not planting a pumpkin crop in 2026 for the first time in 25 years. It says the family started the tradition to teach its children to work and save for college, and the youngest is leaving for college this fall. The family calls this chapter closed but says a later generation might revive it. A Sept. 16 post says it has retired from the pumpkin business. No 2026 patch should be listed without fresh confirmation.\nNov.11, 2026 Newsroom Jack: Retired old assignment per Dan; not a claim of completed reporting or a cancellation of the underlying policy/service. Dan Decision preserved.", "Action Due (local)": "2026-09-29", "Date / Event Date (local)": "2026-06-23"}', 'legacy_do', 'They have reached out for comment - draft story based solely on their public announcement.') on conflict (legacy_key) do nothing;
